OL,3,AIran offers US deal to reopen Strait of
OL,4,AHormuz in seven days
OL,5,
OL,6,FIranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi
OL,7,Fsays his country has proposed a deal to
OL,8,Fthe US that would see the Strait of
OL,9,FHormuz reopened within a week.
OL,11,FAraghchi told reporters at the UN in
OL,12,FNew York that this could be done "if
OL,13,Fthe necessary conditions are met" and
OL,14,Fsaid these were contained within the
OL,15,Fmemorandum of understanding (MOU)
OL,16,Fsigned in June.
OL,18,F"The choice now rests with the United
OL,19,FStates," he said, adding the plan was
OL,20,Fdelivered to the US via Qatar.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
